WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670
A verse in Deuteronomy gives a warning.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.680
Do not add to the commandments.

3
00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.930
Do not take away from them.

4
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:10.410
Orthodox Jews hold that the
Torah, written and oral,

5
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.510
comes from God, and binds every Jew.

6
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.700
But modern life keeps raising
questions no ancient scroll names:

7
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.290
electricity, organ transplants, IVF.

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.070
So if the Torah never changes, how can
it guide Orthodox Jews through every new

9
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.320
century?

10
00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.390
In this mission, you'll follow
the chain of Jewish law,

11
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.790
from Sinai to the great codes.

12
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.510
Then you'll step inside
an Orthodox synagogue,

13
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.650
and through an Orthodox day.

14
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:42.870
Your mission: find out how an unchanging
Torah can guide Orthodox Jews in every

15
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.890
new century.
